      "title": "Hamza",
      "titleArabic": "",
      "hint": "Hamza at the start sits on an alif: أ above for fat-ha and damma, إ below for kasra."
    },
    {
      "id": "p46",
      "title": "Hamza",
      "titleArabic": "",
      "hint": "In the middle, hamza sits on an alif ـأـ, a waw ؤ, or a nabra ـئـ."
    },
    {
      "id": "p47",
      "title": "Hamza",
      "titleArabic": "",
      "hint": "At the end, hamza sits on an alif ـأ, a nabra ـئ, or on the line ء.\nLook! The wavy sign ٓ over a letter of madd means a longer madd. That is the next section!"
    }
